          ],
          "kind": "text",
          "npc": true,
          "name": "Carter Wen",
          "tint": [
            0.9,
            0.8,
            0.6
          ],
          "text": "Roadwolves hit the toll cart at dawn. If you go east, keep to the road. Forest is where they wait.",
          "dialogue": [
            "'I used to run the east road twice a week. Then the toll cart came back with its wheels still turning and no horses.'",
            "'The wolves are not all beasts. Their chief pays deserters in silver and lets them keep whatever they can carry.'"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cell": [
            14,
            13
          ],
          "kind": "text",
          "npc": true,
          "name": "Village Guard",
          "tint": [
            0.7,
            0.8,
            1
          ],
          "text": "Hask Gravelteeth's camp lies far to the east, past the old watchtower road. Bring more than three blades.",
          "dialogue": [
            "'The watchtower bell rings when the wind is from the north. Last night it rang with no wind at all.'",
            "'If you find a brass token in the mud, don't spend it. The old road wardens used those to open the sealed storehouse.'"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
